  "protocol": {
    "system": [
      "System results use ScholarQuest (1,111 queries). Agentic entries are means over three independent runs.",
      "Metrics are query-level macro means over normalized, deduplicated arXiv IDs; the earliest rank is retained.",
      "Recall@All evaluates the complete ranking at termination. Systems retain their original search, expansion, interaction-round and stopping budgets.",
      "Retrieval baselines and agentic systems use ScholarBase. External search services use their own search indexes."
    ],
    "model": [
      "Model configuration results use ScholarQuest-100, with 25 queries per research intent. These scores are not directly comparable to the system track.",
      "Failed or incomplete queries and invalid token records are excluded from both recall and token means; failures are not assigned zero. Valid query sets may differ.",
      "Overall values are query-level macro means over valid queries, weighting intent means by valid query counts.",
      "Planner tokens count reported input and output from the final successful attempt. Failed attempts, preflight requests and Selector usage are excluded. Reasoning is counted once as part of completion.",
      "Configurations differ in prompts, inference settings and tokenizers. GPT-5.6-Sol uses a dedicated keyword-search prompt. Tokens are not verified billing or money."
    ],
    "cases": [
      "Displayed papers are the first three of each appendix gold list, sorted by first arXiv submission date descending. Relevance follows the benchmark title-and-abstract evidence standard."
    ]
  },
  "sources": {
    "systems": "scholarquest_iclr2027.tex: active main results table (tab:main_table)",
